jobs.description:
Bedrijfsomschrijving
You will be joining a reliable and well-known employer where an informal work atmosphere and teamwork are key. At Quantore, new colleagues receive extensive onboarding, so you will quickly feel at home within the team.
We value personal development. That is why you will have the opportunity to learn new skills, take training courses, and advance within the organization.
The Beuningen location is easily accessible by both private vehicle and public transportation.


Functieomschrijving
As an All-Around Warehouse Associate, you are a key link in the logistics process. Thanks to your dedication, all warehouse operations run smoothly and efficiently.
Your responsibilities will include:
- Processing incoming and outgoing goods;
- Checking and managing inventory;
- Picking and preparing orders;
- Assisting with various logistics tasks;
- Contributing to a safe and organized work environment.

Together with your coworkers, you will ensure that every day is a success. No two days are the same, so you will constantly learn new things and continue to grow professionally.


Functie-eisen
We are looking for a motivated colleague who:
- You are physically fit and enjoy active work;
- You speak Dutch and/or English;
- You have a positive attitude and a can-do spirit;
- You work independently, but you are also a team player;
- You are eager to learn and motivated to continue developing yourself;
- You live in the Beuningen, Nijmegen, or Arnhem area.


Arbeidsvoorwaarden
✔ An attractive hourly wage of €15.00
✔ Travel allowance of €0.23 per kilometer (up to 30 km one way)
✔ Vacation pay and opportunities for education and training
✔ Career advancement opportunities within a stable organization
✔ A pleasant work environment with dedicated colleagues
✔ Flexible working hours and a schedule announced two weeks in advance
✔ An easily accessible work location

Are you a friendly and service-minded person who enjoys helping others? Are you good at organizing tasks and making sure everything runs smoothly? Join our team in Enkhuizen and support our Facility Coordinator during an important workplace transformation.

What are you going to do?
As a Facility Support Coordinator, you will support the daily facility activities at our location in Enkhuizen. You will work closely with the Facility Coordinator and help employees and visitors with their questions and needs.

Key responsibilities:

- Support the Facility Coordinator with daily tasks and activities;
- Help with the implementation of the new office environment;
- Support the introduction of the unmanned reception concept;
- Support employees and visitors with facility-related questions;
- Help organize workplace and facility services;
- Work with different teams and stakeholders;
- Make sure tasks are completed correctly and on time;
- Find practical solutions when problems occur.

What do we offer?
- A temporary position to support the current Facility Coordinator;
- You will work 7.6 hours per day, Monday to Friday;
- The position is based on-site in Enkhuizen;
- Salary of €17.50 gross per hour (around €2,880 gross per month);
- 38 hours per week;
- 8.33% holiday allowance;
- Pension plan from the first day of employment;
- Access to the Adecco Academy for further personal and professional development.

Where will you work?
